  the panel now says HOW LONG IS LEFT, read off the rendering phase's own measured slope and shown
  only once that slope has 3 s and 3 % under it (the ratio is not uniform in time — `preparing` hides
  a whole audio decode on a long take — so extrapolating the whole bar would lie). A ring and a
  percentage were enough for a 100 ms instant export; PO's 15m38s take sat in that panel for ~3.5
