- EXPORT FOR AI (AI1, 2026-08-24, reworked the same day on PO's first real take): the export panel's
  second artefact, and it is not a smaller video. One PDF — an index page that BRIEFS ITS READER
  (what the file is, that the pages after it are frames of one recording in time order, why the
